WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.729
C# with no

00:00:01.541 --> 00:00:02.272
runtime

00:00:02.461 --> 00:00:03.121
running on a

00:00:02.933 --> 00:00:04.807
386

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:06.654
Zero C# is

00:00:06.466 --> 00:00:07.150
a fork of

00:00:06.961 --> 00:00:08.093
the bflat compiler

00:00:07.905 --> 00:00:09.142
that turns C#

00:00:08.954 --> 00:00:09.815
straight into a

00:00:09.626 --> 00:00:11.006
small native program

00:00:11.195 --> 00:00:12.114
with no dot

00:00:11.926 --> 00:00:13.234
NET runtime and

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:14.461
no garbage collector

00:00:14.998 --> 00:00:15.658
You keep the

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.259
syntax

00:00:16.307 --> 00:00:17.462
type checking real

00:00:17.274 --> 00:00:18.842
generics interfaces

00:00:18.878 --> 00:00:20.906
records and C# 15

00:00:20.717 --> 00:00:22.262
features like unions

00:00:22.401 --> 00:00:23.544
Memory comes from

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.346
arenas that are

00:00:24.158 --> 00:00:25.089
freed all at

00:00:24.901 --> 00:00:25.549
once

00:00:26.078 --> 00:00:27.103
The same source

00:00:26.915 --> 00:00:27.941
runs on Linux

00:00:27.882 --> 00:00:29.521
macOS Windows and

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:30.983
WebAssembly and even

00:00:30.795 --> 00:00:31.620
on DOS on

00:00:31.432 --> 00:00:33.177
a 386

00:00:33.702 --> 00:00:34.716
Full story on

00:00:34.527 --> 00:00:35.423
the dashboard
